ing Drinkware | Collapsible & Silicone Cups","description":"Custom camping drinkware with collapsible, silicone and compact cup options. Compare current models and get free logo design and product mockups.","html":"<div class=\"bx-site\"><section class=\"bx-business-hero\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-business-grid\"><div><nav class=\"bx-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/\">Home</a> / Custom Camping & Outdoor Drinkware</nav><p class=\"bx-kicker\">APPLICATION / PROCUREMENT PLANNING</p><h1>Custom Camping Drinkware and Collapsible Cups</h1><p class=\"bx-lead\">Build an outdoor branded range around packing space, serving use and handling.</p><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/contact/?models=Custom%20Camping%20%26%20Outdoor%20Drinkware\">Request a Project Quote ↗</a><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/products/\">Explore Product Models</a></div></div><figure class=\"bx-business-photo\"><img src=\"/occ-camping.webp?v=2f98fdbbaf5b\" alt=\"Custom Camping &amp; Outdoor Drinkware — illustrative reference\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption>Planning concept · not an actual customer order or factory photograph.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">START WITH THE BUYING TASK</p><h2>Packed size, components and cleaning</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-two\"><article class=\"bx-panel\"><h3>What matters for this project</h3><p>For collapsible models, define target capacity and both folded and open dimensions.</p><ul><li>Drink or recipient and the intended service setting</li><li>Quantity per design and exact contents of a set</li><li>Required arrival date and delivery destination</li></ul></article><article class=\"bx-panel dark\"><h3>Turn the idea into a reviewable brief</h3><p>Start with a model reference. Then align artwork, sample approval and packing with the project’s deadline.</