ails & Customization</a></div></article></div><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/products/\">Explore the Full Product Catalog →</a></div></section><section class=\"bx-section bx-tinted\"><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>From requirements to an approved order.</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-step-grid\"><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>01</span><h3>Define the brief</h3><p>Share use, quantity, artwork and destination.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>02</span><h3>Agree the proposal</h3><p>Review model, configuration, cost and schedule.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>03</span><h3>Approve the sample</h3><p>Identify the approved artwork and sample version.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>04</span><h3>Produce & deliver</h3><p>Agree inspection, packing and delivery requirements.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-qa\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">BUYER QUESTIONS</p><h2>Clear answers before the next step.</h2></div></div><details><summary>Can I enquire before choosing a model?</summary><p>Yes. Describe the intended use, quantity and arrival date; add a reference or drawing if available.</p></details><details><summary>What determines MOQ and lead time?</summary><p>The model, materials, design versions, decoration, packaging and tooling affect the proposal. Small batches from 10 pieces and fast sampling apply to eligible projects; confirm the conditions in your quote.</p></details><details><summary>What should my enquiry include?</summary><p>A model or product idea, quantity, artwork, pack contents, destination and required arrival date are a useful start.</p></details></div></section><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><section class=\"bx-brief-strip\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Let’s make your project specific.</h2><p>Share the model or idea, quantity, artwork, destination and arrival date. You can add files in the project enquiry.</p></div><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/contact/?models=Custom%20Camping%20%26%20Outdoor%20Drinkware\">Request a Project Quote ↗</a></section></div></div>"},"/zh/camping-drinkware/":{"title":"定制露营杯具｜折叠杯、硅胶杯与免费设计","description":"对比现有折叠杯、硅胶杯及紧凑塑料杯型，为露营活动定制图案。我们提供免费设计方案、产品效果图及具体型号报价。","html":"<div class=\"bx-site\"><section class=\"bx-business-hero\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-business-grid\"><div><nav class=\"bx-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> / 露营与户外杯具定制</nav><p class=\"bx-kicker\">应用场景 / 采购规划</p><h1>定制露营杯与折叠杯</h1><p class=\"bx-lead\">围绕收纳空间、饮用用途及使用方式开发户外品牌系列。</p><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Custom%20Camping%20%26%20Outdoor%20Drinkware\">提交项目询价 ↗</a><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/zh/products/\">浏览产品型号</a></div></div><figure class=\"bx-business-photo\"><img src=\"/occ-camping.webp?v=2f98fdbbaf5b\" alt=\"露营与户外杯具定制 — 视觉参考\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption>规划概念图 · 非实际客户订单或工厂实拍。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">先看采购任务</p><h2>收纳尺寸、组件及清洁</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-two\"><article class=\"bx-panel\"><h3>这个项目先确认什么</h3><p>折叠款需明确目标容量及展开、折叠尺寸。</p><ul><li>饮品或收礼对象，以及实际服务环境</li><li>各设计数量与套装实际组成</li><li>期望到货日期及目的地</li></ul></article><article class=\"bx-panel dark\"><h3>把想法变成可审核的需求</h3><p>先确定参考型号，再让图稿、样品确认与包装对应项目截止日期。</p><ul><li>明确图稿版本与审批人</li><li>根据实际用途审核样品</li><li>区分个人礼品与共用服务工具</li></ul></article></div></section><section class=\"boom-scene-products\" data-scene-route=\"/zh/camping-drinkware/\" data-scene-version=\"20261125\" id=\"boom-scene-products\"><div class=\"boom-scene-heading\"><p class=\"boom-scene-eyebrow\">按活动选产品</p><h2>适配露营与营地聚会的产品</h2><p>为营地饮品配置对比折叠杯、硅胶杯及紧凑杯型。</p></div><div class=\"boom-scene-controls\"><div ar